[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 1.2 System overview

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SIM-001-MILUAV
TITLE: System Overview
STATEMENT: The Military Quad Copter RTOS requires installation on flight control hardware, ground control stations, and supporting infrastructure for military UAV operations.
RATIONALE: System overview provides context for installation procedures.

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 1.3 Document overview

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SIM-002-MILUAV
TITLE: Document Structure
STATEMENT: This document covers installation requirements, referenced documents, installation procedures, and verification steps per MIL-STD-498.
RATIONALE: Structured documentation supports proper system installation.

[[/SECTION]]

