[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 3. Installation requirements

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SIM-003-MILUAV
TITLE: Hardware Requirements
STATEMENT: Installation requires flight control computer, sensors, communication modules, ground control station, and supporting infrastructure meeting military specifications.
RATIONALE: Hardware requirements ensure system compatibility and performance.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SIM-004-MILUAV
TITLE: Software Requirements
STATEMENT: Installation requires RTOS, middleware, drivers, and application software with specific versions and configurations for military deployment.
RATIONALE: Software requirements ensure system functionality and security.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SIM-005-MILUAV
TITLE: Security Requirements
STATEMENT: Installation requires secure boot, encrypted storage, authentication mechanisms, and network security configurations for military environments.
RATIONALE: Security requirements ensure system protection and compliance.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SIM-006-MILUAV
TITLE: Environmental Requirements
STATEMENT: Installation requires controlled environment with proper temperature, humidity, and electromagnetic interference protection for military operations.
RATIONALE: Environmental requirements ensure system reliability and performance.

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 4. Installation procedures

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SIM-007-MILUAV
TITLE: Pre-Installation Checks
STATEMENT: Pre-installation checks include hardware verification, software validation, security clearance, and environmental assessment before installation.
RATIONALE: Pre-installation checks ensure successful installation.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SIM-008-MILUAV
TITLE: Flight Control Installation
STATEMENT: Flight control installation includes RTOS deployment, sensor configuration, communication setup, and system integration on UAV hardware.
RATIONALE: Flight control installation enables autonomous UAV operation.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SIM-009-MILUAV
TITLE: Ground Control Installation
STATEMENT: Ground control installation includes mission planning software, communication systems, and operator interfaces for mission control.
RATIONALE: Ground control installation enables mission management and control.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SIM-010-MILUAV
TITLE: Network Installation
STATEMENT: Network installation includes secure communication infrastructure, encryption systems, and network security configurations for military operations.
RATIONALE: Network installation ensures secure command and control.

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 5. Verification procedures

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SIM-011-MILUAV
TITLE: System Verification
STATEMENT: System verification includes functional testing, performance validation, security assessment, and integration testing after installation.
RATIONALE: System verification ensures proper installation and operation.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SIM-012-MILUAV
TITLE: Documentation Verification
STATEMENT: Documentation verification includes installation records, configuration documentation, and operational procedures for military compliance.
RATIONALE: Documentation verification ensures auditability and compliance.

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 6. Notes

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SIM-013-MILUAV
TITLE: Installation Security
STATEMENT: Installation shall be performed by authorized personnel with proper security clearances and in secure facilities for military systems.
RATIONALE: Installation security ensures system integrity and protection.

[[/SECTION]] 